[{"client_msg_id":"b4b3a194-16c6-474e-aab2-6fd475eddf4f","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"線が揺れたりするの気持ち悪いな","ts":"1615967006.003200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6=zH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ffe485b8-66ec-4048-b7b5-c4b52caa6d16","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"このサイトだとどこから読み始めても良さそう。","ts":"1615964848.002900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Or1P"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bd0145a2-ab65-45e9-8964-8d93e40bd497","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"私もわかるようになりたい。どこから読めばいいのかわからない…","ts":"1615956681.002500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VQBqM"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f75894a4-0302-4374-bf96-186d3635cb61","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"深層学習の基本的なフィードフォワードネットワークはそうですね。一般的な機械学習アルゴリズムはもっと色々あります。","ts":"1615948987.002100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MgfF8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"32824b22-b18d-4010-afbf-6e814d4714e6","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"機械学習、結局ゲームで見慣れた行列演算に非線形な関数を掛けただけの代物ってのがわかってよかったです（遅レス）","ts":"1615943997.000700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V1nCG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ef37925-da7e-4cb6-87a5-54a42ae83d78","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"最近の機械学習とかデータサイエンス見てるともっかい大学行きたくなる。","ts":"1615910484.022500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O9KO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c0c8423b-81e5-47cc-88de-633f55d8a12f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"超わかりやすいWikipediaという印象を受けた","ts":"1615909786.021700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZADyU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9892527d-394a-481f-b69c-2f447cbc4e10","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"ポアソン分布ってめちゃ久しぶりに見たわw","ts":"1615909678.021300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NoR1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42829ca8-390f-4543-99ce-b415d933b6f4","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"いいすね。理解できないならここ見てっていう誘導が良い。","ts":"1615909613.020900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T8j5E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e634d773-5886-43dd-ac79-a9087a41bb49","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"このサイトめっちゃ丁寧に説明してるなぁ。","ts":"1615909341.020500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Wi"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ab969ff-0ad9-44fa-a6c9-528d69baf583","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":"少し分かると機械学習のオモチャ感が分かってきます。(悪い方の意味で)","ts":"1615908879.020100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ylJ3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c2aad685-b5b2-4f11-acb1-6d7ee6ebc2ba","type":"message","user":"U03C6TEAZ","text":":goodpoem:","ts":"1615908727.019400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NWcH7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"66340a5d-bcf9-4af1-a424-851ef65163aa","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"こぐにかるのおかげでこの記事もわかるようになった\nうれしい\n\u003chttps://qiita.com/mattn/items/cdadb93da73d77144ec6|https://qiita.com/mattn/items/cdadb93da73d77144ec6\u003e","ts":"1615907328.018800","attachments":[{"fallback":"Qiita: Vim script で機械学習 - Qiita","id":1,"title":"Vim script で機械学習 - Qiita","title_link":"https://qiita.com/mattn/items/cdadb93da73d77144ec6","text":"この記事は Vim Advent Calendar 2018 の最終日 25 日目の記事です。昨日は rhysd さんの「Vim の構文ハイライトでクリスマスツリー:christmas_tree:を飾ってメリクリする」でした。今年も Vim Advent Cale...","image_url":"https://qiita-user-contents.imgi